# Per-finding gitleaks suppressions (fingerprint = commit:file:rule:line).
#
# Deliberately empty. Prefer an entry here over widening an allowlist in
# .gitleaks.toml — a fingerprint silences ONE known finding, an allowlist
# silences a class — but the best state is no suppressions at all, which
# is where this repo starts.
#
# The previous repo carried one entry for a client_secret committed to its
# history. This repo is a fresh, single-commit history that does not
# contain that commit, so there is nothing to suppress and the
# full-history CI scan gates on genuinely new leaks only.
#
# If you add an entry, say WHY in a comment above it, and prefer fixing
# the finding.
